---
// The expand affordance. A labelled button, not a bare caret - a caret alone
// doesn't read as "press me" to someone who isn't fluent with phones.
// On phones this stretches to the full card width.
---
<span class="more">
  <span class="lbl-open">자세히 보기</span>
  <span class="lbl-close">접기</span>
  <span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
</span>
